# API key file for the course demos (KEY=value, one per line).
#
# .env.example (in a lesson's code folder) is only the template: never put a real key in it,
# because that folder is the one you zip or share.
# Your real key goes in your key file, outside the lesson folders:
#   Windows:      %USERPROFILE%\.ai-automation-from-scratch\.env   (setup.ps1 copies this template there)
#   Mac / Linux:  ~/.ai-automation-from-scratch/.env                (copy this template there yourself)
# Paste your real key in THAT file only. It stays on your computer.
#
# Get a key: https://platform.claude.com  ->  API keys  ->  Create key
# First add about $5 of credit (Billing) and set a monthly spend limit (Limits).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-key-here
